  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Norwegian Emergency Response III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase III - Support to a joint Norwegian emergency and recovery response aimed at saving lives and protecting livelihoods in Ethiopia. Three NGOs - NCA, DF and NRC - are cooperating within WASH, food security and shelter. The geographical focus is three zones of Somali and Borena zone of Oromia regional states, Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </description>
